          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-9-958-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b5e1",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 9,
      "hadithIndex": 959,
      "bookHadithIndex": 153,
      "text": "Ibn Ubaid bin Umair narrated from his father:\"Ibn Umar was clinging on the two corners (in a manner that I had not seen any of the Companions of the Prophet doing) so I said: 'O Abu Abdur-Rahman! You are clinging on the two corners in a manner that I have not seen any of the Companions of the Prophet clining.' So he said: 'I do it because I heard the Messenger of Allah saying: \"Touching them atones for sins.\" And I heard him saying: \"Whoever performs Tawaf around this House seven times and he keeps track of it, then it is as if he freed a slave.\" And I heard him saying: \"One foot is not put down, nor another raised except that Allah removes a sin from him and records a good merit for him",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-9-959-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-9-959-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-9-959-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-9-959-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b5e2",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 9,
      "hadithIndex": 960,
      "bookHadithIndex": 154,
      "text": "Ibn Abbas narrated that :the Prophet said: \"Tawaf around the House is similar to Salat except that you talk during it. So whoever talks in it, then let him not say but good",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-9-960-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-9-960-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-9-960-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b5e3",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 9,
      "hadithIndex": 961,
      "bookHadithIndex": 155,
      "text": "Ibn Abbas narrated that:The Messenger of Allah said about the (Black) Stone: \"By Allah! Allah will raise it on the Day of Resurrection with two eyes by which it sees and a tongue that it speaks with, testifying to whoever touched it in truth",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-9-961-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-9-961-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-9-961-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-9-961-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b5e4",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 9,
      "hadithIndex": 962,
      "bookHadithIndex": 156,
      "text": "Ibn Umar narrated:\"The Prophet would apply oil that is not scented (Ghair Muqattat) while he was a Muhrim",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-9-962-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Daif Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-9-962-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Daif Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-9-962-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b5e5",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 9,
      "hadithIndex": 963,
      "bookHadithIndex": 157,
      "text": "Hisham bin Urwah narrated :from his father about Aishah, that she would carry some Zamzam water, and she would say: \"Indeed the Messenger of Allah would carry it",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-9-963-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-9-963-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-9-963-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c745dd1a4c9c86f0b5e6",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 9,
      "hadithIndex": 964,
      "bookHadithIndex": 158,
      "text": "Abdul-Aziz bin Rufai narrated:\"I said to Anas bin Malik: 'Narrated something to me that you understand about where the Messenger of Allah performed Zuhr on the Day of Tarwiyah.' He said: 'In Mina.'\" \"I said: 'So where did he pray Asr on the day of departure?' He said: 'In Al-Abtab.' Then he said: 'Do what your leaders do",
      "grades": [
